index 00000000000..9e5e087db87
--- /dev/null
+++ b/doc/changes/dev/14434.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1 @@
+Fix ``split_naming="bids"`` since  :meth:`mne.io.Raw.save` and :meth:`mne.Epochs.save` put ``split`` after ``desc``, but ``split`` should come before ``desc``,  by `Hamza Abdelhedi`_.
